<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>I can't go home, anymore</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PRYVT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">I can't go home, anymore</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">24rRtHoieCETAUB59COeZB</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.505" end="00:19.880">서운했던 마음은</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.880" end="00:24.114">누굴 위하는 마음이였을까?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.114" end="00:27.978">혹시라도 그때는</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.978" end="00:31.150">이 마음이 너에게 닿을까?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.150" end="00:33.170">싶었던 나에겐</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.170" end="00:35.178">기다리던 난데</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.178" end="00:39.112">Maybe I knew that you were moving on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.112" end="00:41.075">나만 또 이렇게</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.075" end="00:43.182">혼자 서있는데</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.182" end="00:47.606">너가 말하던대로, 달라졌어 넌</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.606" end="00:51.099">So take me home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.099" end="00:59.099">Baby, I don't need you to come and lie anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.171" end="01:09.987">But what can I do without you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.987" end="01:13.958">'Cause I don't want love without you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.958" end="01:21.958">Just come back home (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.969" end="01:25.779">There's nowhere to go, anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.779" end="01:31.317">I'm fine being here all alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.317" end="01:39.317">Don't you worry 'bout me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.988" end="01:43.988">Oh, don't you worry 'bout me</p></div></body></tt>